1) experience researching, interpreting and applying civilian human resources classification and position management policies and practices to provide management advisory and classify position descriptions;
2) experience researching, analyzing and evaluating a wide range of Federal sector classification theories, concepts, precedents or regulations to solve civilian human resources issues;
